 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SlashZero is a 3D anime-style side-scrolling action roguelike game. In this game, you can unleash flashy moves, dive into thrilling combat and customize endless builds to suit your playstyle. Fight, power up, collect items and uncover the hidden truth beneath this stunning cyberpunk world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/4c1ad56ab4acbeab86b089b6cde0ed35.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master rich movesets and in-depth combat combos featuring signature aerial strings. Dash, vault, and fight across multi-layered maps for smooth, parkour-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/ab0da7b85b90821e695b25a228b1587b.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every strike with precise hit feedback. Diverse level designs keep every battle fresh and challenging. Dominate foes by blending acrobatic finesse with tactical combat strategy to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d058c1e630e8c033f2c74fe75fcb14f6.webp?t=1788488817\" width=440 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different Timehackers and find the combat playstyle that suits you best. Are you a melee expert? A ranged specialist? Or do you prefer something more flexible in both offense and defense? Find your style as you experience each character's unique movesets and explore their stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/a02750050c63ea2647d0529e6bf2b68d.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix<i> </i>and<i> </i>match<i> </i>a<i> </i>wide<i> </i>range<i> </i>of<i> </i>in-run<i> </i>and<i> </i>out-of-run<i> </i>systems<i> </i>to<i> </i>shape<i> </i>your<i> </i>own<i> </i>combat<i> </i>build.<i> </i>In every run, you can choose a path and grow stronger as you follow it.<i> </i>Combine<i> </i>the<i> </i>power<i> </i>of<i> </i>Blessings<i> </i>from<i> </i>different<i> </i>Authorities,<i> </i>harness<i> </i>the<i> </i>run-changing<i> </i>effects<i> </i>of<i> </i>Temporal<i> </i>Fragments,<i> </i>and<i> </i>equip<i> </i>Upgrade<i> </i>Chips<i> </i>that<i> </i>can<i> </i>fundamentally<i> </i>reshape<i> </i>how<i> </i>your<i> </i>character<i> </i>plays.<i> </i>Back<i> </i>at<i> </i>the<i> </i>base,<i> </i>unlock<i> </i>permanent<i> </i>progression<i> </i>options<i> </i>to<i> </i>prepare<i> </i>for<i> </i>what<i> </i>comes<i> </i>next.<i> </i>Increase<i> </i>your<i> </i>stats,<i> </i>acquire<i> </i>Dual<i> </i>Blessings,<i> </i>gain<i> </i>additional<i> </i>rerolls, and more! You may even get to bring your own preset builds<i> </i>into<i> </i>future<i> </i>runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d6195da9abbcd7c17b22ca0a85b02c1c.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the timelines collapse, HIEROS-I descends, and he intends to drag every timeline toward destruction.<i> </i>As<i> </i>a<i> </i>Timehacker,<i> </i>the<i> </i>fate<i> </i>of<i> </i>the<i> </i>world<i> </i>falls<i> </i>to<i> </i>you.<i> </i>Guided<i> </i>by<i> </i>the<i> </i>mysterious<i> </i>voice<i> </i>known<i> </i>as<i> </i>Silver,<i> </i>travel<i> </i>across<i> </i>timelines,<i> </i>gather<i> </i>greater<i> </i>power,<i> </i>seek<i> </i>out<i> </i>Timeline<i> </i>Zero,<i> </i>hunt<i> </i>down<i> </i>the<i> </i>Lord<i> </i>of<i> </i>the<i> </i>Void,<i> </i>and<i> </i>put<i> </i>an<i> </i>end<i> </i>to<i> </i>HIEROS-I<i> </i>before<i> </i>everything<i> </i>is<i> </i>lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
